    "body": {
      "value": "Large mining and construction vehicles represent substantial investments. The Vehicle Suppression System installs in the engine compartment and other risk-identified zones to safeguard both assets and operators. Deploys a kinetically charged Foam Mist agent, tailored to the operating environment. Linear Heat Detection Tubes trigger suppression automatically — resilient to vibration and temperature, gradual cooling with no thermal shock, human-safe, quick recharge with minimal downtime.",
